    <h2 style="color:var(--primary);margin-top:40px">What is VELYS Robotic Knee Replacement?</h2>
    <p>VELYS is an imageless robotic-assisted total knee replacement system. Unlike older CT-based platforms (Mako, ROSA), VELYS does not require a pre-operative CT scan. During surgery, specialised probes register your knee's anatomy, dedicated software models ligament tension and joint movement in real time, and a robotic arm guides bone cuts with sub-millimetre precision. The surgeon remains fully in control; the robot improves accuracy and ligament balance.</p>

