      {q:"Who performs VELYS robotic knee replacement at DHS Multispecialty Hospital?", a:"The DHS robotic knee programme is led by Dr. Hardik Shah (Medical Director, MS Orthopedic, FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat Shah (FIAAS UK). The DHS knee programme has successfully performed 2,000+ knee replacement surgeries (robotic and conventional) with high patient satisfaction."},
